# 📊 Difference Between Array and Slice

| Array         | Slice        |
| ------------- | ------------ |
| Fixed Size    | Dynamic Size |
| Faster        | Flexible     |
| Cannot Resize | Can Resize   |
| Less Used     | Most Used    |

---

# 🎯 Interview Questions

### Q1. What is an Array?

An array is a fixed-size collection of elements of the same data type.

---

### Q2. What is a Slice?

A slice is a dynamic and flexible view of an array.

---

### Q3. Which function is used to add elements to a slice?

```go
append()
```

---

### Q4. Which function returns the length of an array or slice?

```go
len()
```

---

### Q5. Which function returns the capacity of a slice?

```go
cap()
```

